          {
            "x": 2.178649237472767,
            "y": 12.910611231371064,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Influence on Operating Systems</strong><br>\nThompson's influence on the field of operating systems is monumental. His work on UNIX set the stage for a multitude of software tools and operating systems that followed. UNIX's design principles are evident in many subsequent operating systems, including Linux and BSD, and have influenced the architecture of modern software systems.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Later Career and Legacy</strong><br>\nIn his later career, Ken Thompson continued to innovate. He co-developed the Go programming language at Google, where he worked until his retirement. His legacy is not only in the tools and languages he created but also in his approach to software design, which emphasizes simplicity and effectiveness.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Ken Thompson's Impact on Technology and Culture</strong><br>\nKen Thompson's work has had a significant impact on both technology and culture. The creation of UNIX and his other contributions have shaped the computing world and influenced the open-source software movement. His efforts have made technology more accessible and transformed the way people use and interact with computers.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
